  "_doc": "Words for 在哪儿 answers. proper: names of countries and cities; they never take 里 (在中国, not 在中国里). places: words that are places by themselves (在家, 在学校; 里 is optional). objects: things that need a localizer to become a place, with the localizer suggested when it is missing (在桌子上, not 在桌子). localizers: localizer words (方位词) grouped by meaning; the key is the group name. notPlaces: time words that can follow 在 but are not places (在晚上). notReversed: words that begin with a localizer but are not 'localizer + place' (上车 = to get on, not 车上). STARTER LIST: must be reviewed by a Chinese teacher.",
